    # The herdr dev box's lookup targets, resolved from a VM guest through its
    # default resolver (E17). A finite VM Job: the guest program looks each name up
    # with getaddrinfo, opens a bare TCP connection to the first resolved IPv4
    # address on 443, then looks up one name that does not exist, and exits.
    [job]
